'''Gale Force''' is a counter, itself has no effect. However, [[Gathering Winds]] [[ascendancy passive skill]] of the [[Deadeye]], which grants Gale Force, scales the effect of {{stl|Tailwind}} per Gale Force. The notable ascendancy passive skill behind the [[Gathering Winds]], [[Wind Ward]], further augment the player per Gale Force.

Note that {{c|help|Each instance of Gale Force lasts 4 seconds. Maximum 10 Gale Force.}}
==Sources==
* [[Gathering Winds]]: {{c|mod|Gain 1 '''Gale Force''' when you use a [[Active skill|Skill]]}}
* [[Wind Ward]]: {{c|mod|Lose all '''Gale Force''' when [[Hit]]}}

==Effects==
* [[Gathering Winds]]: {{c|mod|10% increased Effect of Tailwind on you per '''Gale Force'''}}
* [[Wind Ward]]: {{c|mod|4% less Damage taken per '''Gale Force'''}}

==Version history==
